WEBVTT

00:02:29.036 --> 00:02:30.156
"If only" --

00:02:30.196 --> 00:02:32.676
And that's the catch phrase
of regret, "if only" --

00:02:32.716 --> 00:02:34.236
"If only I'd done the work."

00:02:34.276 --> 00:02:35.796
Second category.

00:02:36.276 --> 00:02:38.156
I love this category, it's fascinating.

00:02:38.196 --> 00:02:40.356
Boldness regrets.

00:02:40.356 --> 00:02:45.756
I have hundreds of regrets
around the world that go like this:

00:02:45.756 --> 00:02:49.996
“X years ago, there was a man/woman
whom I really liked.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:52.716
I wanted to ask him/her out on a date,

00:02:52.716 --> 00:02:54.716
but I was too scared to do it

00:02:54.756 --> 00:02:56.396
and I've regretted it ever since."

00:02:56.436 --> 00:02:58.836
I also have hundreds of regrets
by people who said:

00:02:58.876 --> 00:03:00.836
"Oh, I always wanted to start a business,